<Rive version="1" kind="fragment">
  <!--
    document-scan: concentric optic-scan overlay designed for document framing, focus and review.
    View model SignalStudio { mode: calm|pulse|burst, intensity: 0-100, playing: boolean }.
    mode picks the motion state (1 slow ring, 3 rings, 5 fast rings); playing=false holds a still diagram;
    intensity scales the field and thickens every ring stroke.
    Ring keyframes are linear in t = ((frame - offset) mod period) / period:
    diameter = 28 + 312 * t, opacity = 0.95 * (1 - t).
  -->
